The TypeScript adaptation replaces Java threads with event-loop scheduling,
Swing painting with SVG, and Java collections with JavaScript collections.
Core layout calculations follow TGLayout 1.21. The nonlinear lens follows
HyperScroll 1.06, including its sampled inverse. Locality additions at
equal distance use stable BFS ordering rather than Hashtable ordering.

