Cokus MT19937 random number generator

The generator in src/ir/topics/cokus.ts is Shawn Cokus's March 8, 1998
recoding of MT19937, distributed in David Blei's lda-c. The underlying
MT19937 code credits Makoto Matsumoto and Takuji Nishimura (1997).
